silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_03_materialization_spine_sections_04_install_and_observe_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_install_and_observe #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Install and Observe: The Spine Closes' the bare symbol RuntimeAtom anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
